Package: datacard
Title: Describe the Structure of a Dataset Without Exposing the Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pingboi", email = "94149299+Pingboi@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Writes a Markdown file that describes the columns, types,
    categories and formats of a data frame under fixed disclosure rules. The
    file can be shared, for example with an AI assistant, so that others can
    help with code and research without seeing the data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: dplyr, stats, stringr, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
